    "text": "By TJ Turner ,\n18 hours ago HORRY COUNTY, SC (WMBF) - Lanes are blocked after a Wednesday morning crash on North Highway 701 that sent 1 to the hospital. Horry County Fire Rescue was dispatched around 5:30 a.m. to the area of North Highway 701 above Highway 22 regarding a crash. HCFR says that one person... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
